372	     * equals the given key, ignoring any owner flagged {@link Owner#isDeleted() deleted}. Used as
373	     * the single duplicate-detection check at creation time: a new owner is a duplicate only when
374	     * its whole identity key matches a non-deleted existing owner's.
375	     */
376	    @Override
